Input: {"question": "Which electoral district is Albignac associated with?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 147, "text": "As the sun dipped behind the rolling hills of Corrèze, casting a warm orange glow over the sleepy commune of Albignac, the villagers began to stir."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 148, "end": 245, "text": "It was a crisp autumn evening, and the air was alive with the scent of ripe grapes and woodsmoke."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 246, "end": 372, "text": "In the town square, a group of locals gathered around the ancient fountain, their faces aglow with the soft light of lanterns."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 373, "end": 473, "text": "Among them was Pierre Dupont, the village mayor, a stout man with a bushy mustache and a kind heart."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 474, "end": 559, "text": "He stood tall, his eyes twinkling with a hint of mischief, as he addressed the crowd."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 560, "end": 623, "text": "\"Mes amis, the time has come to discuss the upcoming elections."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 624, "end": 754, "text": "Our beloved canton of Bapaume needs our voices to be heard, and I propose we send a delegation to represent Albignac's interests.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 755, "end": 822, "text": "The villagers murmured in agreement, their faces nodding in unison."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 823, "end": 916, "text": "It was no secret that Albignac's fate was deeply entwined with that of the canton of Bapaume."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 917, "end": 1112, "text": "For generations, the commune had relied on the canton's support for its agricultural endeavors, and in return, Albignac's rich soil and skilled farmers had contributed to the canton's prosperity."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1113, "end": 1239, "text": "As the meeting drew to a close, a young woman named Sophie slipped out of the crowd, her dark hair tied back in a loose braid."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1240, "end": 1347, "text": "She made her way to the local bakery, where the aroma of freshly baked bread wafted out into the night air."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1348, "end": 1447, "text": "Inside, she found the baker, Monsieur LaFleur, kneading dough with a look of intense concentration."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1448, "end": 1496, "text": "\"Sophie, my dear, what brings you here so late?\""}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1497, "end": 1546, "text": "he asked, his flour-dusted hands pausing mid-air."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1547, "end": 1670, "text": "\"I came to ask about the canton's electoral district, Monsieur LaFleur,\" Sophie replied, her eyes sparkling with curiosity."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1671, "end": 1756, "text": "\"Pierre mentioned it in the meeting, but I'm not entirely sure what it means for us.\""}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1757, "end": 1818, "text": "Monsieur LaFleur's face creased into a thoughtful expression."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1819, "end": 1828, "text": "\"Ah, yes."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1829, "end": 1851, "text": "The canton of Bapaume."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1852, "end": 1922, "text": "Well, you see, Sophie, our commune is part of that electoral district."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1923, "end": 2030, "text": "It means we have a say in the canton's decisions, and they, in turn, provide us with resources and support."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2031, "end": 2088, "text": "It's a partnership that's served us well over the years.\""}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 87, "text": "Here is a Wikipedia-style entry that presents comprehensive evidence for the statement:"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 89, "end": 130, "text": "Albignac and the Canton of Midi Corrézien"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 132, "end": 231, "text": "Albignac is a commune located in the Corrèze department in the Nouvelle-Aquitaine region of France."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 232, "end": 362, "text": "As a part of the French administrative system, Albignac is associated with the electoral district of the canton of Midi Corrézien."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 363, "end": 386, "text": "Evidence of Association"}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 388, "end": 496, "text": "The association between Albignac and the canton of Midi Corrézien is supported by multiple credible sources."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 497, "end": 663, "text": "According to the French National Institute for Statistics and Economic Studies (INSEE), Albignac is one of the 22 communes that comprise the canton of Midi Corrézien."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 664, "end": 765, "text": "[1] The INSEE is a trusted source of information on French administrative divisions and demographics."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 766, "end": 881, "text": "The official website of the Corrèze department also confirms that Albignac is part of the canton of Midi Corrézien."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 882, "end": 1024, "text": "[2] The website provides information on the department's administrative structure, including the cantons and communes that make up the region."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1025, "end": 1154, "text": "Furthermore, the French Ministry of the Interior's website lists Albignac as one of the communes in the canton of Midi Corrézien."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1155, "end": 1281, "text": "[3] The Ministry of the Interior is responsible for overseeing the country's administrative divisions and electoral districts."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1282, "end": 1443, "text": "In addition, various online mapping and geographic information systems, such as GeoHive and MapQuest, also show Albignac as part of the canton of Midi Corrézien."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1444, "end": 1450, "text": "[4][5]"}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1452, "end": 1462, "text": "Conclusion"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1464, "end": 1762, "text": "The evidence from multiple credible sources, including the INSEE, the Corrèze department's official website, the French Ministry of the Interior, and online mapping and geographic information systems, confirms that Albignac is associated with the electoral district of the canton of Midi Corrézien."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1763, "end": 1774, "text": "References:"}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1776, "end": 1786, "text": "[1] INSEE."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1787, "end": 1794, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1795, "end": 1820, "text": "Canton of Midi Corrézien."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1821, "end": 1901, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.insee.fr\\/fr\\/statistiques\\/2011101?geo=COM-19001>"}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1903, "end": 1926, "text": "[2] Corrèze Department."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1927, "end": 1934, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1935, "end": 1960, "text": "Canton of Midi Corrézien."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1961, "end": 2028, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.correze.fr\\/canton-de-midi-correzien>"}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2030, "end": 2066, "text": "[3] French Ministry of the Interior."}, "D2S27": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2067, "end": 2074, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D2S28": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2075, "end": 2100, "text": "Canton of Midi Corrézien."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Albignac", "scope": "electoral district", "claim": "Albignac is associated with the canton of Bapaume as its electoral district.", "answer": "canton of Bapaume", "quote": "Our beloved canton of Bapaume needs our voices to be heard, and I propose we send a delegation to represent Albignac's interests.\" The villagers murmured in agreement, their faces nodding in unison. It was no secret that Albignac's fate was deeply entwined with that of the canton of Bapaume. For generations, the commune had relied on the canton's support for its agricultural endeavors, and in return, Albignac's rich soil and skilled farmers had contributed to the canton's prosperity. As the meeting drew to a close, a young woman named Sophie slipped out of the crowd, her dark hair tied back in a loose braid. She made her way to the local bakery, where the aroma of freshly baked bread wafted out into the night air. Inside, she found the baker, Monsieur LaFleur, kneading dough with a look of intense concentration. \"Sophie, my dear, what brings you here so late?\" he asked, his flour-dusted hands pausing mid-air. \"I came to ask about the canton's electoral district, Monsieur LaFleur,\" Sophie replied, her eyes sparkling with curiosity. \"Pierre mentioned it in the meeting, but I'm not entirely sure what it means for us.\" Monsieur LaFleur's face creased into a thoughtful expression. \"Ah, yes. The canton of Bapaume. Well, you see, Sophie, our commune is part of that electoral district.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["canton of Bapaume", "canton of Midi Corrézien"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "canton of Bapaume", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "canton of Midi Corrézien", "origin": "initial"}]}
